{"2722716670":{"description":"Sculpture <em>Le Courage</em> by <a href=\"http://www.hanneke-beaumont.com/\">Hanneke Beaumont</a> at <a href=\"http://www.pilane.se/index_eng.htm\">Pilane 2008</a>. Stitched Panorama (3 images). More about this in my <a href=\"http://bodwigg.wordpress.com/2008/08/16/skulptur-pa-ett-gravfalt/\">blogg</a> and <a href=\"http://ulfbodin.wordpress.com/2008/08/29/2510-13-le-courage-by-hanneke-beaumont/\">blog</a>"},"2723528870":{"description":"Stitched Panorama  (some Photoshop stuff)"},"3644479470":{"description":"Stitched Panorama"},"3793064870":{"description":"C2448"},"4237346070":{"description":"0482-83. Stitched Panorama"},"4624923570":{"description":"2226"},"4826351470":{"description":"3754"},"4850414670":{"description":"3937"},"5004725170":{"description":"6814. Minimalistiskt Fotosöndag.\n\nJag vet nog inte riktigt vad minimalism är för något eller hur en minimalistisk bild ska se ut. Jag tolkar det kanske som att visa så mycket som möjligt med så lite medel som möjligt. Att bara visa så lite som möjligt (vilket var frestande) är kanske &quot;bara&quot; någon sorts abstraktion för mig. Men jag ändrar mig säkert om någon säger emot."},"5336693570":{"description":"9151-55. Stitched Vertorama (5 images)"},"5548141870":{"description":"10679"},"6085201970":{"description":"16130-31. Stitched Vertorama. 24 mm f/7.1"},"6851532470":{"description":"21387"},"7414475070":{"description":"24778-82. Stitched Panorama"},"7863676270":{"description":"29368"},"7923559570":{"description":"29936"},"7991888770":{"description":"31257"},"8105621870":{"description":"32289"},"8265501270":{"description":"33876"},"8381968670":{"description":"33283"},"15500251170":{"description":"X26241."},"16638292070":{"description":"X17101-107."},"17127235070":{"description":"3M00443-45. Everything nice has its end."},"20243739370":{"description":"X29237-39. Vertorama."},"23550321970":{"description":"PB170015-16."},"24799325570":{"description":"3M05180."},"25639115470":{"descr